I spent two months on a project to move Finland’s road and street infrastructure data into a new system for Fintraffic. As the UI/UX designer, I focused on making sure the system was usable and accessible. I created the UI design based on the specification and reviewed the color definitions for what is shown on the map. I also tested that the technical implementation matched the specification, the design, and the minimum accessibility requirements.

The wider project is still in progress, and the system will be launched in 2027.
